; Point IX at the exits of the actor's location
;
; Takes the location record of the current actor (#R$9D37) and sets IX to its
; exit list minus one exit record (+7), the starting position for walkers that
; step IX by 3 before reading (#R$9B93). The exit records are direction,
; obstacle object, destination.
;
; O:IX Location record + 7
@label=SeekActorExits
c$9E95 PUSH DE
 $9E96 CALL $9D37
@isub=LD DE,EXITS_BIAS
 $9E99 LD DE,$0007
 $9E9C ADD IX,DE
 $9E9E POP DE
 $9E9F RET
